---
title: Base
---
{#
  Organization-facing landing layout.

  Mirrors landing.njk, but the hero, features, and CTAs address the
  organization running the fundraiser (team, band, chapter, church) rather
  than the merchant. Every page closes with a merchant block, because shops
  also land on these pages looking for the other side of the same program.

  Optional frontmatter:
    lede — overrides the hero paragraph
#}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" dir="ltr">

<head>
{%- set pageCss = ["index.css", "page.css"] -%}
{%- set seoTitle = title + ' | Fundlet' -%}
{% include "head.njk" %}
</head>

<body>

{% include "header.njk" %}

<!-- ===== HERO ===== -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-bg" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="ambient"></div>
    <div class="silo"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="hero-grid">
      <div class="hero-text">
        <span class="eyebrow">Fundraising for organizations</span>
        <h1>{{ title }}</h1>
        <p class="lede">{% if lede %}{{ lede }}{% else %}Sell real products from a real shop, with no order forms, no cash envelopes, and no spreadsheet at the end. Every supporter checks out online, every sale is credited to the participant who made it, and you see the total as it climbs.{% endif %}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-visual">
        <div class="shot">
          <img src="{{ '/resources/img/fundlet-landing-page.webp' | url }}" alt="A Fundlet campaign page an organization shares with its supporters" style="aspect-ratio:4/3;width:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:top center;" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-foot">
      <div class="hero-cta">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{ '/contact' | url }}">Book a free 30-min consultation</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#details">How it works for you</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="{{ '/discover-organizations' | url }}">All organization guides</a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-meta">
        <div class="m"><b>0</b><span>Paper order forms</span></div>
        <div class="m"><b>1 link</b><span>Per participant</span></div>
        <div class="m"><b>Automatic</b><span>Sales credited by name</span></div>
        <div class="m"><b>{{ site.rating.value }} ★</b><span>App store · {{ site.rating.ratingCount }} reviews</span></div>
        <div class="m"><b>No cash</b><span>Everything through checkout</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===== HOW IT WORKS FOR THE ORGANIZATION ===== -->
<section class="block">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">What your group actually does</span>
      <h2>Three steps, and none of them involve collecting cash.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="feature">
      <div class="feature-text">
        <span class="feature-num">01 — Sign up your group</span>
        <h3>One form, one afternoon.</h3>
        <p>A shop running Fundlet sends you a single onboarding link. You enter your group, your goal, and your dates — and your campaign page is live with the shop's products on it.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>No account to create, no software to learn</li>
          <li>Your group name and goal on a branded page</li>
          <li>Works from a phone, at a practice or a meeting</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="shot">
        <img src="{{ '/resources/img/fundlet-onboarding.webp' | url }}" alt="The Fundlet onboarding form an organization fills out" style="aspect-ratio:4/3;width:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:top center;" />
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="feature">
      <div class="feature-text">
        <span class="feature-num">02 — Share your links</span>
        <h3>Every participant gets their own link.</h3>
        <p>Each member gets a personal link to text, post, or email. Anything bought through that link is credited to them automatically, so nobody has to remember who sold what.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Supporters pay the shop directly at checkout</li>
          <li>Out-of-town family and alumni can buy too</li>
          <li>No money changes hands at your meetings</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="shot">
        <img src="{{ '/resources/img/popup-shop.png' | url }}" alt="A participant's shareable Fundlet campaign link" style="aspect-ratio:4/3;width:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:top center;" />
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="feature">
      <div class="feature-text">
        <span class="feature-num">03 — Watch the total</span>
        <h3>You know where you stand, daily.</h3>
        <p>A shared dashboard shows progress toward your goal and a per-participant breakdown. When the campaign closes, the payout is already calculated — there is nothing to tally.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Progress tracked against your goal</li>
          <li>Totals by participant, for prizes or service hours</li>
          <li>Exportable records for your treasurer</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="shot">
        <img src="{{ '/resources/img/fundlet-tracking.webp' | url }}" alt="The Fundlet dashboard showing fundraising progress by participant" style="aspect-ratio:4/3;width:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:top center;" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===== REVIEW ===== -->
<section class="block tint">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="review feature-review">
      <span class="tag">Popus Gourmet Popcorn</span>
      <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
      <p>THIS IS THE BEST!!! Mathew is SUPER responsive! We launched our initiative and raised over $11,000 in less than a week! It works great, highly customizable. Self contained in house fundraising has never been easier. Especially if you are a shop and need to host multiple fundraisers.</p>
      <div class="who"><b>Popus Gourmet Popcorn</b>Shopify App Store · United States</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===== PAGE CONTENT ===== -->
<section class="block" id="details">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="page-content">
      {{ content | safe }}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===== MERCHANT BLOCK ===== -->
<section class="block tint" id="for-shops">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">For shops</span>
      <h2>Run the other side of this fundraiser.</h2>
      <p class="lede">If you sell a physical product on Shopify or Square, Fundlet is how you offer this program. Campaigns, participant tracking, and payout math install into the store you already run — your products, your branding, your checkout, and a group of new customers who came to you through a cause.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-cta">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://apps.shopify.com/fundlet">
        <svg class="sh" viewBox="0 0 109.5 124.5" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M74.7,14.8c0,0-1.4,0.4-3.7,1.1c-0.4-1.3-1-2.8-1.8-4.4c-2.6-5-6.5-7.7-11.1-7.7c-0.3,0-0.6,0-1,0.1c-0.1-0.2-0.3-0.3-0.4-0.5c-2-2.2-4.6-3.2-7.7-3.1c-6,0.2-12,4.5-16.8,12.2c-3.4,5.4-6,12.2-6.7,17.5c-6.9,2.1-11.7,3.6-11.8,3.7c-3.5,1.1-3.6,1.2-4,4.5C9.1,40.7,0,111.2,0,111.2l75.6,13.1V14.6C75.2,14.7,74.9,14.7,74.7,14.8z M57.2,20.2c-4,1.2-8.4,2.6-12.7,3.9c1.2-4.7,3.6-9.4,6.4-12.5c1.1-1.1,2.6-2.4,4.3-3.2C56.9,12,57.3,16.9,57.2,20.2z M49.1,4.3c1.4,0,2.6,0.3,3.6,0.9c-1.6,0.8-3.2,2.1-4.7,3.6c-3.8,4.1-6.7,10.5-7.9,16.6c-3.6,1.1-7.2,2.2-10.5,3.2C31.7,19.1,39.8,4.6,49.1,4.3z M37.4,59.3c0.4,6.4,17.3,7.8,18.3,22.9c0.7,11.9-6.3,20-16.4,20.6c-12.2,0.8-18.9-6.4-18.9-6.4l2.6-11c0,0,6.7,5.1,12.1,4.7c3.5-0.2,4.8-3.1,4.7-5.1c-0.5-8.4-14.3-7.9-15.2-21.7C23.8,51.8,31.4,40.1,48.2,39c6.5-0.4,9.8,1.2,9.8,1.2l-3.8,14.4c0,0-4.3-2-9.4-1.6C37.4,53.5,37.3,58.2,37.4,59.3z M61.2,19c0-3-0.4-7.3-1.8-10.9c4.6,0.9,6.8,6,7.8,9.1C65.4,17.7,63.4,18.3,61.2,19z"/>
          <path d="M78.1,123.9l31.4-7.8c0,0-13.5-91.3-13.6-91.9c-0.1-0.6-0.6-1-1.1-1c-0.5,0-9.3-0.2-9.3-0.2s-5.4-5.2-7.4-7.2V123.9z"/>
        </svg>
        Add to Shopify Store
      </a>
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://raise.fundlet.app" data-square-info>
        <img class="sq" src="{{ '/resources/img/square-logo-white.svg' | url }}" alt="" />
        Add to Square Store
      </a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="{{ '/discover' | url }}">Guides by shop type</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===== FINAL CTA ===== -->
<section class="cta-band">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="cta-inner">
      <span class="eyebrow plain" style="color:var(--on-panel-2)">Get started</span>
      <h2>Bring Fundlet to your next fundraiser.</h2>
      <p>Already have a shop in mind? Send them this page. Not yet? Book a free 30-minute call and we will help you find the right fit and plan your first campaign.</p>
      <div class="hero-cta">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{ '/contact' | url }}">Free 30-min consultation</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="{{ '/discover-organizations' | url }}">All organization guides</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="{{ '/faq' | url }}">Read the FAQ</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "footer.njk" %}

</body>

<script src="{{ '/resources/js/app.js' | url }}"></script>

</html>
